  ButtonBox["SimplicialJoin",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Taggar/SimplicialHomology/ref/SimplicialJoin"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"3c2a04b4-e6fe-0b49-9769-99b9b8194d21"],
 " appropriately relabels the vertex sets."
}], "Notes",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9924810575209923`*^9, 3.992481124675482*^9}, {
  3.994634359578888*^9, 3.9946343611111374`*^9}},
 CellID->577314174,ExpressionUUID->"1f3cc829-9ef5-c742-a40f-f6365556c835"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The join of simplicial complexes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["sc", "TI"], "1"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9ee6f0f1-6ff4-c544-9920-c99419f7cc4e"],
 " and ",
